  "description": "Token budget management for .NET 10 LLM agent loops. Tracks conversation growth, masks stale tool output, summarizes older history when needed, and keeps requests within a configured limit. Targets net10.0 only.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "TokenGuard.Core",
