  "packageHash": "EGK5MOpcfy+gdqkYIoHTHK3feEtNfY46OND+5ARb5gC1qvIFepLjxVXOr62tElJa7+Wu02O5YAVi8Rvs27P8aw==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 287442,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/svetstoykov/TokenGuard",
  "published": "2026-10-21T06:02:54.093Z",
  "readmeFile": "PackageReadme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Opens the library to custom parts: the public ILlmSummarizer contract with replaceable summary instructions, WithTokenCounter for one counter shared across contexts, WithCompactionStrategy for a custom strategy per conversation, and a public EstimatedTokenCounter. Prepare results report stage counts, the unchanged prefix, the summarization status and a token breakdown, also as tags on tokenguard.prepare activities. SlidingWindowOptions.ExemptToolNames names tools whose results are never masked.\n\nBehavior changes, with no signature changes: a recorded tool result above a token limit, on by default at the smaller of 25,000 and a quarter of MaxTokens, is stored shortened with a notice in place of its middle; the compaction strategy receives its budget on the estimate scale, inverted from the provider correction; pretty-printed JSON is charged for its whitespace; a tool result is masked only when its placeholder is smaller; the summarizer request is built to a token budget and its output cap is twice the target; summarizer diagnostics name the summarizer type and normalize finish reasons. Prepared views can differ from those of 1.2.0 for the same history. Fixes text holding half of a surrogate pair, a provider input count of zero, and an invalid placeholder format.\n\nKnown limits: one ConversationContext is for one caller at a time, and overlapping calls are detected on a best-effort basis; token estimates leave out request overhead such as tool schemas until the first provider report; with the tool result limit turned off, one tool result larger than the window cannot be fitted and the prepare returns CompactionInsufficient; the package targets net10.0 only.\n\nFull details: https://github.com/svetstoykov/TokenGuard/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
